# VitaGram language file. Copy this file to <code>.lang and translate the values after "=".
# Keys must stay unchanged; a missing key falls back to English.
#   {0} {1} ...   arguments inserted by the program (keep them, the order may change)
#   {cross} {circle} {square} {triangle} {dpad} {start} {select}
#                 controller button icons - keep these tokens, never type the glyphs
#   \n            line break;  "text" in quotes keeps leading/trailing spaces

